(text "Each host contact has a separate jumper and screw. Repeated rails and bus functions join on the Arduino." (at 16.51 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) ) (justify left)) (uuid 4f94538b-215c-5764-b576-6da934d8c76c))
(text "J1–J4 and underside socket J5 mate directly. Use the labeled cable inputs J6–J9 for the appropriate board." (at 16.51 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) ) (justify left)) (uuid dccaf630-9dbf-55d5-ae84-0a06c00cc930))
